- The dashboard doesn't replace your subscriber's validation logic — it gives it a visual interface
- Real-time dashboards are standard practice across the security industry
- Your dashboard answers four questions: Is it running? What are the readings? Has anything been blocked? What happened recently?

The dashboard has five visual sections:

Header — shows "GRAND MARINA," a live clock, and a green "LIVE" indicator that turns red if the WebSocket disconnects
Maya section — a welcome message from Maya for the operator
